# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# device-api-consumer — .gitignore
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── .NET build output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# ── NuGet ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
[Pp]ackages/
!**/[Pp]ackages/build/

# ── Test results & coverage ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
TestResults/
coverage/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverlet.json

# ── IDE: Visual Studio ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vs/
*.rsuser
*.vsp
*.vspx
*.sap

# ── IDE: JetBrains Rider ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# ── IDE: VS Code ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json

# ── OS artefacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# contracts/  — runtime-generated files vs committed files
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# IGNORED  — written by consumer tests at runtime (PactNet output); re-generated
#            on every test run. In CI this is uploaded as the "pact-contracts"
#            artifact and downloaded by the provider CI for verification.
contracts/DeviceApi-Consumer-DeviceApi.json

# COMMITTED — documentation explaining the contracts/ directory
# contracts/README.md

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# tests/DeviceApi.Consumer.Tests/Generated/
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Skeleton stubs auto-generated by provider's SwaggerPactGenerator and delivered
# via a PR (create-stub-pr CI job). The *.cs stub files ARE committed so the
# consumer team can review and complete them inside the PR.
# Only the README.md placeholder is always present; stubs come and go with PRs.
#
# Do NOT add a blanket ignore for this folder.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Publish / deployment artefacts
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
publish/
**/publish/
